      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since you\u0027re only updating 2 bits here can we make those the parameters? Can the signature be:\n\nvoid syv682x_emul_set_control_4_interrupts(\n        struct i2c_emul *emul, bool vbat_ovp, bool vconn_ocp);",
